<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:sy="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/"><channel><title>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise on 医行天下</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/categories/%E5%85%BB%E7%94%9F%E5%8A%9F%E6%B3%95-meditation-exercise/</link><description>Recent content in 养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise on 医行天下</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh</language><copyright>©2025, All Rights Reserved</copyright><lastBuildDate>Wed, 12 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/categories/%E5%85%BB%E7%94%9F%E5%8A%9F%E6%B3%95-meditation-exercise/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>关于打坐 | 不得不说的几个窍诀(三)</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%89%93%E5%9D%90%E7%AA%8D%E8%AF%803/</link><pubDate>Fri, 02 Dec 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Fri, 02 Dec 2022 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%89%93%E5%9D%90%E7%AA%8D%E8%AF%803/</guid><description>一定要花时间调整身体(三) 关于背部 背放松 微含胸 背部要注意，不要太直。太直，呼吸时气容易被压迫，应含胸驮背。 含胸，气息就比较充足。慢慢到了功夫</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%89%93%e5%9d%90%e7%aa%8d%e8%af%803.assets/640-1671594238595-179.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>静坐</category><category>站桩</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>关于打坐 | 不得不说的几个窍诀(二)</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%89%93%E5%9D%90%E7%AA%8D%E8%AF%802/</link><pubDate>Tue, 29 Nov 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Tue, 29 Nov 2022 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%89%93%E5%9D%90%E7%AA%8D%E8%AF%802/</guid><description>一定要花时间调整身体(二) 因为环境问题，凡夫心随境转。环境一变化就心浮气躁，日常一定要注意这方面的心理弱点，因为环境肯定是越来越差。学佛者都</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%89%93%e5%9d%90%e7%aa%8d%e8%af%802.assets/640-1671628409288-210.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>静坐</category><category>站桩</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>关于打坐 | 不得不说的几个窍诀(一)</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%89%93%E5%9D%90%E7%AA%8D%E8%AF%801/</link><pubDate>Thu, 24 Nov 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Thu, 24 Nov 2022 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%89%93%E5%9D%90%E7%AA%8D%E8%AF%801/</guid><description>气脉是否通畅 中国五千年文化有很多非常了不起的传承，比如说道家、佛家的等等。我们发现，从古至今得到一些成就的人基本上是通过打坐获得的。比如王阳</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%89%93%e5%9d%90%e7%aa%8d%e8%af%801.assets/640-1671630296005-237.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>静坐</category><category>站桩</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>[置顶]站桩与静坐详细教程</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/meditation-detailed-guide/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sun, 21 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/meditation-detailed-guide/</guid><description>姿势与要领 那么站桩和静坐，首先来讲它们的原理其实是一样的，只不过我们把它区分了。 从相上来讲，一个是站着，一个是坐着。现在来讲的话，我们很多人</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/meditation-detailed-guide.assets/9109a2_7a6f160881b244028452d0f0a2b2c727mv2.webp" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>静坐</category><category>站桩</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>七星连珠共修：意犹未尽</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E4%B8%83%E6%98%9F%E8%BF%9E%E7%8F%A0%E5%85%B1%E4%BF%AE-%E6%84%8F%E7%8A%B9%E6%9C%AA%E5%B0%BD/</link><pubDate>Wed, 12 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 12 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E4%B8%83%E6%98%9F%E8%BF%9E%E7%8F%A0%E5%85%B1%E4%BF%AE-%E6%84%8F%E7%8A%B9%E6%9C%AA%E5%B0%BD/</guid><description>在逐步接近七星连珠的日子，天地间的能量迅速爆棚。为了更好的修炼身体，大家最好做到： 1）👉辟谷，或者日中一食； 2）早睡早起； 3）参加我们每天的</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e4%b8%83%e6%98%9f%e8%bf%9e%e7%8f%a0%e5%85%b1%e4%bf%ae%20%e8%84%91%e8%a2%8b%e6%b8%85%e6%98%8e%20%e6%95%b4%e4%b8%aa%e8%ba%ab%e4%bd%93%e5%8f%98%e5%be%97%e7%a9%ba%e6%98%8e.assets/image-20250316181452326.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>站桩</category><category>静坐</category><category>站桩打坐</category><category>七星连珠共修</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>七星连珠共修：身心轻安</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E4%B8%83%E6%98%9F%E8%BF%9E%E7%8F%A0%E5%85%B1%E4%BF%AE-%E8%BA%AB%E5%BF%83%E8%BD%BB%E5%AE%89/</link><pubDate>Sun, 09 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sun, 09 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E4%B8%83%E6%98%9F%E8%BF%9E%E7%8F%A0%E5%85%B1%E4%BF%AE-%E8%BA%AB%E5%BF%83%E8%BD%BB%E5%AE%89/</guid><description>人体结构与整个宇宙极为相似。七星对应我们身体的七轮；而七轮又与脊柱督脉密不可分。“督脉通，百病不生。” 脉轮能量出现了问题，导致我们的身体出现</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e4%b8%83%e6%98%9f%e8%bf%9e%e7%8f%a0%e5%85%b1%e4%bf%ae%20%e8%84%91%e8%a2%8b%e6%b8%85%e6%98%8e%20%e6%95%b4%e4%b8%aa%e8%ba%ab%e4%bd%93%e5%8f%98%e5%be%97%e7%a9%ba%e6%98%8e.assets/image-20250316181452326.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>站桩</category><category>静坐</category><category>站桩打坐</category><category>七星连珠共修</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>隔空的能量：不一般的站桩打坐，你一定要亲自体会</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E9%9A%94%E7%A9%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F-%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E7%9A%84%E7%AB%99%E6%A1%A9%E6%89%93%E5%9D%90-%E4%BD%A0%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%9A%E8%A6%81%E4%BA%B2%E8%87%AA%E4%BD%93%E4%BC%9A/</link><pubDate>Fri, 07 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Fri, 07 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E9%9A%94%E7%A9%BA%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F-%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E7%9A%84%E7%AB%99%E6%A1%A9%E6%89%93%E5%9D%90-%E4%BD%A0%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%9A%E8%A6%81%E4%BA%B2%E8%87%AA%E4%BD%93%E4%BC%9A/</guid><description>自加入杨医生团队的站桩共修群也有四五个月了。站桩，给我的感觉是润物细无声。在不知不觉中，我的体能得到了提高。 以前爬楼、奔跑几步就会气喘的不行</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e9%9a%94%e7%a9%ba%e7%9a%84%e8%83%bd%e9%87%8f%20%e4%b8%8d%e4%b8%80%e8%88%ac%e7%9a%84%e7%ab%99%e6%a1%a9%e6%89%93%e5%9d%90%20%e4%bd%a0%e4%b8%80%e5%ae%9a%e8%a6%81%e4%ba%b2%e8%87%aa%e4%bd%93%e4%bc%9a.assets/image-20250316181206883.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>站桩</category><category>静坐</category><category>站桩打坐</category><category>七星连珠共修</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>七星连珠共修：脑袋清明、整个身体变得空明...</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E4%B8%83%E6%98%9F%E8%BF%9E%E7%8F%A0%E5%85%B1%E4%BF%AE-%E8%84%91%E8%A2%8B%E6%B8%85%E6%98%8E-%E6%95%